    <!-- Phase 3a: a request waits for an answer. The first push of a day swap, a change request or a
         custody proposal ends with this sentence when the proposer chose a deadline. It travels as
         epoch millis and this phone says it in its own zone, language and clock
         (%1$s = a weekday, a day and a time, as in "Tue, Oct 13, 10:00"). -->
    <string name="push_answer_by">Antworte bis %1$s.</string>
    <!-- The proposer gave the parent who did not answer in time a last chance
         (%1$s = the proposer's name, %2$s = the weekday, day and time it ends). -->
